  "title": "Two views of a brain scan: a calibrated 3D CNN and tree stack for DaT-SPECT",
  "eyebrow": "Competition · DrivenData · 2026",
  "summary_html": "A stacked 3D CNN ensemble and gradient-boosted tree model that separates abnormal from normal DaT-SPECT scans with out-of-fold AUROC 0.9455. The CNN ensemble&#x27;s probabilities are calibrated to an ECE of 0.0187, and the baseline&#x27;s calibration carried over to held-out acquisition families at a log-loss cost of +0.0006<sup class=\"cite\"><a href=\"#sources\" title=\"Source: vault note drivendata-dat-parkinsons-challenge\">[src]</a></sup>.",
